TITLE: Caching API Calls with shareReplay - Angular/RxJS - TypeScript
DESCRIPTION: Implements a caching mechanism for an HTTP GET request using the RxJS shareReplay operator. Subsequent calls to getCommonMovies() will receive the cached response without making a new HTTP request until the observable completes.
SOURCE: https://github.com/avivharuzi/angular-best-practices/blob/main/README.md#_snippet_31

LANGUAGE: TypeScript
CODE:

```
class MoviesService {
  private commonMovies$: Observable<Movie[]> | null = null;


  getCommonMovies(): Observable<Movie[]> {
    if (!this.commonMovies$) {
      this.commonMovies$ = this.httpClient.get<Movie[]>('/api/movies/common').pipe(
        shareReplay(1),
      );
    }

    return this.commonMovies$;
  }
}
```

